              "name": "Md5Sha1Hash",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "MD5 / SHA-1 hash"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "This is broken or deprecated even without a quantum computer, so fix it now: SHA-256 or better instead of MD5/SHA-1, AES-GCM or ChaCha20-Poly1305 instead of DES/3DES/RC4/ECB, and TLS 1.2 at minimum (1.3 if you can)."
              },
              "help": {
