              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The JWT is signed with RSA, ECDSA or EdDSA. Tokens are short-lived, so this is not urgent, but whatever issues them should be able to change algorithm without a redeploy. IETF is working on ML-DSA for JOSE/COSE."
              },
